{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A depth-first search: a lazy sequence of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DepthFirstSearchEvent"},{"type":"text","text":"s, with every edge classified as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a tree, back, forward or cross edge. It holds a copy of the graph and can be iterated more than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"once. The search keeps its own stack, so a deep graph cannot overflow the call stack."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/traversal\/depthfirstsearch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/Iterator"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/postorder","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/preorder"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/forEach(_:)","doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/makeIterator()"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/Element"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal\/DepthFirstSearch\/Sequence-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Traversal\/documentation\/Traversal"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DepthFirstSearch","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","